      "description": "Renaming a .ts file to a non-TypeScript path (e.g. `git mv src/sum.ts src/sum.js`) still skips typecheck. `git diff --cached --name-only` detects renames by default and lists only the new path, so the `\\.(ts|tsx)$` regex misses it while importers of the old path break. Adding `--no-renames` to line 108 lists the old .ts path too.",
