      "description": "The amendment skips typecheck for a commit that 'stages no TypeScript and no package.json or tsconfig*.json', but since 3aa3baf a commit that only deletes such a file still typechecks. 'Stages' reads as additions and edits only; adding 'including a deletion' would match the script.",
